cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference the repeated-plane-sections-with-cavity method, please
  cite it as below.
title: "Plane sections and cavities: a new method for an old kitchen problem"
abstract: >-
  Priority-of-publication declaration for a repeated-plane-sections method
  (Cavalieri's principle applied station by station) with a deduced or
  measured internal cavity, applied to both heating (cooking) and cooling
  (freezing) times for whole, irregular and hollow bodies — as far as the
  author knows, the first published application of this method to this
  problem. Companion to the KitchenMetrics app.
authors:
  - family-names: Petrucci
    given-names: Andrea
type: generic
repository-code: "https://github.com/apetrucci90-rgb/kitchenmetrics-plane-sections-en"
license-url: "https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-13
keywords:
  - cooking science
  - heat transfer
  - freezing time
  - plane sections
  - Cavalieri's principle
  - hollow carcass
